@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-turn-21-prep.puml
' purpose: turn 21 is gas tier 3 + TurnBonusBubble — not a freeze/levy
' status: OUTDATED — shipped broadcast; product = StarChess
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/rules/constants.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
' live spec: _spec/apps/starchess/core/turn/turn-bonus-broadcast.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' incomeForTurn(turn > 20) = 3. Live single-player already broadcasts
' milestones 1 · 11 · 21 and holds the clock until the bubble dismisses.
' king-attack-2 is already seeded at turn 21 so Tactical Jump is legal.
' Inventing a prep levy to match the title would teach a house rule.
title OUTDATED — turn 21 is the tier-3 bubble;\ndo not invent a prep freeze

component "energyForTurn(21) = 3" as TIER <<app>>
component "TurnBonusBubble\nmilestones 1 · 11 · 21" as BUB <<app>>
component "king-attack-2 seed" as LESSON <<app>>
component "**clock jumps / prep levy**" as SKIP <<error>>

TIER ARROW_MAIN BUB
TIER ARROW_OPTIONAL LESSON
SKIP ARROW_ERROR BUB

note bottom of BUB
  **The planning clock stays null until
  the bubble dismisses.** Tutorial and
  review never broadcast. That is the
  freeze; it already resumes the same
  turn.
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Open ""turn-bonus-broadcast.puml"".
  Do not resemble a turn-45 hang —
  that cap is ""scOutcome"".
end legend
@enduml
